ont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">SpaceX在星链业务中部署Grok语音系统，日均处理1.5万通电话</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI与Kiro达成深度合作，GPT-5.6模型家族正式接入软件开发平台</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta将在数周内推出Hatch AI智能体，并于10月发布Watermelon模型</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动发布AI办公智能体“豆包工作”，深度打通飞书生态实现全流程自主执行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/acfb503548a4849d4cc98a099927eca1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动正式发布面向生产力场景的AI Agent产品“豆包工作”，通过自主任务规划、跨工具调用及虚拟桌面操控能力，推动AI办公从内容辅助生成向全流程自主执行演进。该产品支持文档撰写、PPT制作、网页搭建及轻量化系统开发，并创新搭载虚拟桌面功能，允许在后台执行复杂任务的同时保持可视化操作。豆包工作核心优势在于与飞书生态深度整合，能调用群聊、文档、会议纪要及多维表格等企业私有数据，解决通用大模型缺乏业务上下文的痛点。目前已落地项目周报生成、客户需求提炼、业务风险识别及经营策略分析四大场景。在安全层面，依托飞书企业级合规底座，实现任务执行全链路防护。用户现可通过doubao.com/work下载电脑版，官方提供限时30天免费订阅权益，旨在加速AI Agent在企业业务中的规模化落地。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">WikiHow正式起诉OpenAI侵权，指控其未经授权抓取超1.1万篇教程训练模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/029998e3b105360fbdf6e5e3140439aa.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">全球协作式生活指南百科WikiHow近日向美国曼哈顿联邦法院提起诉讼，指控OpenAI在未经许可的情况下，擅自抓取其超过11,000篇教程文章用于训练ChatGPT及GPT系列大语言模型，涉嫌侵犯至少1,200项已注册版权。WikiHow在诉状中指出，ChatGPT能够直接复现其文本内容并生成同类教程，导致用户无需访问原网站即可获取答案，严重分流了核心流量并削减了广告收入，打击了创作者生产高质量内容的动力。WikiHow要求法院判令OpenAI进行赔偿，并下达强制禁令阻止其继续侵权。对此，OpenAI发言人回应称，模型训练使用的是公开数据，行为符合“合理使用”原则。此案被视为衡量AI模型训练与传统版权保护边界的关键风向标。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceX在星链业务中部署Grok语音系统，日均处理1.5万通电话</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6c5eb96e7ca97191fd85c90b5d150e2c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceX已将xAI旗下的Grok语音系统全面部署至星链（Starlink）项目，应用于客户支持与销售业务。最新运营数据显示，该AI语音系统目前日均处理超过15000通全球客户咨询及销售电话，并实现每周独立完成超过3000笔商业订单。此次落地标志着大模型语音交互技术已跨越理论验证阶段，在大规模商业化客服与销售场景中具备了实际作战能力。通过将Grok语音系统深度融合至海量业务场景，SpaceX不仅显著降低了传统人工客服与销售团队的运营成本，也为全球高频次商业交互的智能化转型提供了新路径，验证了AI Agent在复杂企业级服务中的高效率与高转化价值。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与Kiro达成深度合作，GPT-5.6模型家族正式接入软件开发平台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4884ec035ee1189b4c1c1af2ae0d74e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI与软件开发代理平台Kiro达成深度合作，正式将GPT-5.6模型家族（包含Sol、Terra、Luna）引入Kiro工作流。此次集成覆盖软件规划、构建、审查及测试全生命周期，通过规范驱动开发模式，使模型能精准理解团队代码库与项目需求。在AWS底层优化支持下，GPT-5.6在Terminal-Bench 2.1测试中表现优异，其中Terra模型在完成复杂开发任务时成本削减约82%。开发者可利用该模型将产品创意转化为结构化实现计划，并进行多步骤编码与属性测试。OpenAI与AWS表示，此次合作旨在通过提升模型性价比与运行效率，加速AI原生开发进程，帮助技术团队在软件开发全周期内实现更高投资回报。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta将在数周内推出Hatch AI智能体，并于10月发布Watermelon模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/24d89f46d98eebd61dd14a8254fff6bb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta计划在未来数周内推出消费级AI智能体平台Hatch，并预计于10月发布下一代AI模型Watermelon。Hatch基于OpenClaw方向开发，旨在从对话式AI转型为可自主执行任务的智能助手，早期版本已支持访问DoorDash、Etsy、Reddit、Yelp及Outlook等第三方服务，并提供可定制化面板以管理工具与技能。在商业化方面，Meta考虑为Hatch引入分级订阅方案，高级版月费最高或达199.99美元，旨在通过直接面向消费者的收入模式降低对广告业务的依赖。Watermelon模型作为Meta最新的研发成果，其具体定位及是否纳入现有模型体系尚待确认。此次布局标志着Meta正加速从模型研发向消费级智能体应用落地转型，直接对标OpenAI与Anthropic等竞争对手，进一步完善其在AI助手市场</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
